			<div class="content" id="post-content-4010260">
									

<p>Image source: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20170614-OC-PJK-0604_(35302276585).jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20170614-OC-PJK-0604_(35302276585).jpg</a> Photo by Preston Keres. &quot;Work of a United States Department of Agriculture employee, taken or made as part of that person's official duties. As a work of the U.S. federal government, the image is in the public domain.</p>
<p>Co-author: Zyn</p>
<p>Big thanks to our reviewers in chat!</p>
<ul>
<li>taylor_itkin, for logical inconsistencies and birb behavior</li>
<li>Drakkar, for discussing detail points</li>
<li>Lazar, for pointing out sciencey things and inconsistencies</li>
<li>pwasmadragon1, Uncle Nicolini, and Alces_alces for helping with conceptualization</li>
<li>XilasCrowe, birb robes for lightning birb wizard</li>
<li>hauntedhouse/rounderhouse, for nitpicks</li>
<li>weryllium, for spot fixes and detail crit</li>
<li>Pratten, for a readthrough right before this went live!</li>
</ul>
<p>And in case anyone is interested in some extras, have a test log!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Title&nbsp;for&nbsp;showing&nbsp;text</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Title&nbsp;for&nbsp;hiding&nbsp;text</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Addendum 4384-2:** The following is an excerpted experimental log involving SCP-4384. The trials were conducted on ██/██/20██ by Dr. Roe to deduce different reactions of SCP-4384 from stimuli.</p>
<table class="wiki-content-table">
<tr>
<th>Stimulus</th>
<th>Test Results</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Common rabbit introduced into the enclosure.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 shows no signs of interest, watching subject for a few moments before perching atop a branch.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Instance of <em>Thamnophis sirtalis sirtalis</em> (Eastern garter snake) introduced into the enclosure.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 shows no signs of interest, proceeding to preen itself for several minutes until the conclusion of the test.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Instance of <em>Cerastes cerastes</em> (Desert Horned Viper) introduced into the enclosure.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 becomes exceptionally hostile, producing shrieks of over 180-decibels and attempting to claw at the snake with its talons.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-297937-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-297937-1')">1</a></sup></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>D-20151<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-297937-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-297937-2')">2</a></sup> instructed to enter the enclosure.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 produces a shrill emission, causing temporary deafness in D-20151.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>D-21867 instructed to enter enclosure, bearing a mask of Haida make, similar to the one discovered with SCP-4384.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 remains silent for several moments, before cautiously flying near D-21867. After a short period of examination, SCP-4384 returns to its perch, showing no additional signs of interest.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Dr. Roe<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-297937-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-297937-3')">3</a></sup> instructed to enter the enclosure.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 immediately becomes curious, flying towards Dr. Roe before promptly perching on her shoulder. SCP-4384 later returns to roost on top of one of the aviary mews.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>A recording of a red-tailed hawk shriek is played.</td>
<td>SCP-4384 produces a mating call commonly associated with male instances of <em>Buteo Jamaicensis</em> and ruffles its feathers. It prepares to lift off from its perch, but then pauses and quickly folds its wings. SCP-4384 makes no additional response to repeat playing of the recording.</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
