<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-297937-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-297937-2')">2</a>. Note: D-20151 was convicted for various charges of arson and manslaughter.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-297937-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-297937-3')">3</a>. Part of the SCP-4384 containment team, selected for participation based on background in veterinary biology and commendations for exemplary employee behavior.</div>
</div>

